frontend/scripts/test-harness/*.out

# UI atlas — the 150 per-route screenshots are EVIDENCE FOR A RUN, not source. They are ~37MB and
# regenerate in one command, so committing them would bloat every clone forever for something a
# script reproduces:
#     cd frontend && node scripts/capture-ui-atlas.mjs && node scripts/build-ui-contact-sheets.mjs
# What IS tracked is the reviewable half — the contact sheets (docs/ui-atlas/sheet-*.png) and the
# measurements (index.json / sheets.json), which is what docs/UI_ATLAS.md is written against and
# matches how docs/tvsf-build-guide keeps a curated set rather than a dump.
docs/ui-atlas/*.jpg
